{"c":[{"id":"29c75b2055bfd649","sum":"Session view: corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line, never guessed. ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none in migrations/*.sql vs the head schema golden; no column docs from migration comments, @doc rejected. From skills/sr-search, root scripts/ is ../../scripts.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ff5f55b02102dc3e","sum":"Session view: corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits. ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none comments in migrations/*.sql, checked against the head schema golden.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T210631Z-10740a97904ab604","text":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T161011Z-2822e87bc8170386","text":"Warehouse ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none comments in migrations/*.sql plus coverage against the head schema golden; not a Python relationship list and not a dummy DuckDB.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e2a08ee3dba79144","sum":"Migration SQL comments are a write log, not a glossary: no column docs from them; @rel vs the head snapshot is the ERD edge source, @doc rejected. From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts, not ../scripts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T162700Z-98da0bcb31c97c64","text":"Do not generate column-meaning docs from migration SQL comments: the chain is a write log, not a glossary. @rel vs head snapshot is the ERD edge source; @doc is rejected.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T164244Z-bd1d99298ee63baa","text":"From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts — not ../scripts (that is skills/scripts).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"fd833a13d357171f","sum":"ERD views get Mermaid alias labels name[\"name (view)\"] (%% comments do not render), pinned by a rendered-output contract; sr-query SKILL.md keeps what the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); no user-level uv indexes.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"262cf27713e88954","sum":"Warehouse ERD views are labeled with Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]: %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes, so views (session_token_usage) need a visible label, pinned by a rendered-output contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T190402Z-6371376f562b82e0","text":"QA for warehouse-schema-docs failed: Mermaid %% view comment is invisible in rendered ERD, so session_token_usage is not visually distinguished from tables; Build must make views visibly labeled/styled and add a rendered-output contract.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T190854Z-e3140d8fbabc94db","text":"Warehouse ERD views use Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]; %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f0937a1056310039","sum":"sr-query SKILL.md keeps meanings the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); stockroom install never writes user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T192526Z-070c0a987fc44833","text":"sr-query: replacing the column catalog with the ERD dropped meanings the picture cannot show; keep thinking-not-captured, tool-inputs-only, and project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint in SKILL.md.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260913T191146Z-bac17d4e200b9c2d","text":"Stockroom install must not write user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
